## Checkpoint 04C.1 implementation status

04C.1 is implemented and run-pending. It deliberately avoids a broad search.
It uses only the historically motivated C1 agronomic CatBoost candidates from
03C.2:

```text
depth 4, learning_rate 0.03, l2 3
depth 4, learning_rate 0.06, l2 6
depth 5, learning_rate 0.06, l2 3
```

Each candidate averages seeds 42, 314 and 2718. The stable first candidate is
also blended at fixed 10/20/30% weights with the frozen Local04D and Graph04D
baselines. A controlled LOSO gate can select only Local04D, direct stable
CatBoost, or the three Local+CatBoost blends. This avoids repeating the overly
large candidate-universe issue observed in exploratory 04D routing.

